{"anon_id": "P3-f564a4f7", "direction": 2, "claims": 2, "timing": 1, "total": 5, "pass": true, "gap_note": "据东北与炸亡证实，终局运档宽尺度记部分对齐"}
{"anon_id": "P3-f581f30f", "direction": 2, "claims": 1, "timing": 1, "total": 4, "pass": true, "gap_note": "侄无被害证实，寅日验点无从核（中性记1）"}
{"anon_id": "P3-f62d94a2", "direction": 1, "claims": 1, "timing": 1, "total": 3, "pass": false, "gap_note": "连生二子与有子合，木命之女一节未核；无时点可核（中性记1）"}
{"anon_id": "P3-f66e16a2", "direction": 2, "claims": 2, "timing": 1, "total": 5, "pass": true, "gap_note": "终老东宫如断，终身无出期无具体时点可核（中性记1）"}
{"anon_id": "P3-f6c5f877", "direction": 1, "claims": 1, "timing": 0, "total": 2, "pass": false, "gap_note": "官非麻烦同向而对象错位，主坐标乙亥日偏为八月"}
{"anon_id": "P3-f6c88bde", "direction": 1, "claims": 1, "timing": 1, "total": 3, "pass": false, "gap_note": "店有事而止与难撑部分合，亏损量级未载；无时点可核（中性记1）"}
{"anon_id": "P3-f9173d37", "direction": 2, "claims": 2, "timing": 2, "total": 6, "pass": true, "gap_note": "无"}
{"anon_id": "P3-f969aa30", "direction": 2, "claims": 1, "timing": 1, "total": 4, "pass": true, "gap_note": "有雨证实而大雨与雨量不大断不合，主坐标申日偏为巳日，窗口含实应"}
{"anon_id": "P3-fa99bb15", "direction": 2, "claims": 1, "timing": 1, "total": 4, "pass": true, "gap_note": "刑部系统官职证实而丁巳峰值运与罢官自记不合"}
{"anon_id": "P3-fb0a624b", "direction": 2, "claims": 2, "timing": 1, "total": 5, "pass": true, "gap_note": "蔡赢初选并胜选证实；无具体时点可核（中性记1）"}
{"anon_id": "P3-fb198f9e", "direction": 0, "claims": 0, "timing": 1, "total": 1, "pass": false, "gap_note": "结局为午月覆舟而亡，与所问房价无关；午月与主坐标月份重合而事件无关"}
{"anon_id": "P3-fb7f93ed", "direction": 2, "claims": 2, "timing": 1, "total": 5, "pass": true, "gap_note": "遇赦脱狱且后显要证实，壬戌日与寅月坐标仅部分对齐"}
{"anon_id": "P3-fd22ccdf", "direction": 2, "claims": 1, "timing": 0, "total": 3, "pass": false, "gap_note": "寿不遐证实而主坐标戌年偏为当年四月"}
{"anon_id": "P3-fd85850c", "direction": 2, "claims": 1, "timing": 0, "total": 3, "pass": false, "gap_note": "寿元有限证实而主坐标未年偏为卯年"}
{"anon_id": "P3-fdb6c553", "direction": 2, "claims": 1, "timing": 1, "total": 4, "pass": true, "gap_note": "非巫蛊与改药后愈合，窗口一至两周偏为约三周"}
{"anon_id": "P3-fe42e61d", "direction": 2, "claims": 2, "timing": 2, "total": 6, "pass": true, "gap_note": "无"}
{"anon_id": "P3-ff4f4f2f", "direction": 2, "claims": 2, "timing": 1, "total": 5, "pass": true, "gap_note": "附子可用而次日愈证实，戌日坐标无从核，窗口含实应"}
{"anon_id": "P3-ff69b2df", "direction": 1, "claims": 1, "timing": 0, "total": 2, "pass": false, "gap_note": "败血后复完胎语义含混，安向部分合而主坐标亥月偏为三日后"}
{"anon_id": "P3-ffbcbb93", "direction": 0, "claims": 0, "timing": 0, "total": 0, "pass": false, "gap_note": "断升迁不成，实辰年两调一升至督府"}
